<title>UK: CRICKET-AUSTRALIA DECLARE SECOND INNINGS WITH LEAD OF 468.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-AUSTRALIA DECLARE SECOND INNINGS WITH LEAD OF 468.</headline>
<dateline>MANCHESTER, England 1997-07-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australia declared their second innings at 395 for eight wickets, a lead of 468, on the fourth day of the third test against England at Old Trafford on Sunday.</p>
<p>Scores: Australia 235 and 395-8 (S.Waugh 116, M.Waugh 55, S.Warne 53), England 162 (M.Butcher 51; S.Warne 6-48, G.McGrath 3-40).</p>
